{"date":"2023-03-22","title":"Release Notes for 3/22/2023","url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/5125698536876922545","kind":"patch","sections":[{"title":"COUNTER-STRIKE 2 LIMITED TEST","lines":[{"text":"Shipped the mechanism for players to gain access to the Counter-Strike 2 Limited Test.","dir":"mid"},{"text":"If you have been selected to participate in the limited test, you will see an invitation banner when you launch CS:GO with further instructions.","dir":"mid"}]},{"title":"MAPS","lines":[{"text":"Ember","dir":"mid"},{"text":"-Introducing Ember spring update","dir":"mid"},{"text":"-The chickens have laid colourful eggs","dir":"mid"},{"text":"-Replaced cannonballs with eggs","dir":"mid"},{"text":"-Festive Tablet image","dir":"mid"},{"text":"-Weeds","dir":"mid"},{"text":"-General updates","dir":"mid"},{"text":"-Added new path at Swimming Pool","dir":"mid"},{"text":"-Players no longer take damage from slow rolling cannonballs","dir":"mid"}]}],"slug":"2023-03-22"}